        "correction": "f'(a) = lim(h→0) [f(a+h) − f(a)] / h. C'est le taux de variation instantané en a."
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "question_id": 2,
        "type": "vrai-faux",
        "answer": "vrai",
        "correction": "Le nombre dérivé f'(a) est précisément le coefficient directeur de la tangente en ce point."
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "question_id": 3,
        "type": "vrai-faux",
        "answer": "vrai",
        "correction": "VRAI. [f(3+h)−f(3)]/h = [(3+h)²−9]/h = [9+6h+h²−9]/h = 6+h → 6 quand h→0."
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "question_id": 4,
        "type": "qcm",
        "answer": "",
        "correction": "Tangente en a : y = f(a) + f'(a)·(x−a). Pente = f'(a), passe par (a, f(a))."
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "question_id": 5,
        "type": "vrai-faux",
        "answer": "vrai",
        "correction": "Le taux de variation est la pente de la droite sécante reliant (a, f(a)) à (b, f(b))."
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "question_id": 6,
        "type": "vrai-faux",
        "answer": "vrai",
        "correction": "VRAI. f(1) = 1−2 = −1. f'(x) = 2x−2, f'(1) = 0. Tangente : y = −1 + 0·(x−1) = −1."
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "question_id": 7,
        "type": "qcm",
        "answer": "",
        "correction": "f'(a) = 0 → pente nulle → tangente horizontale (parallèle à l'axe des x)."
      },
